/** @mainpage kde3-apps
*
* kde3-apps collects the applications of the KDE3 revival desktop that
* are not part of kdelibs, kdebase or kdepim.
*
* From kdeutils:
*
* - ark, an archive manager
* - kcalc, a scientific calculator
* - kcharselect, a character selector
* - kdf, a free disk space viewer
* - khexedit, a binary file editor
* - ktimer, a countdown launcher
* - kwalletmanager, the KWallet manager
*
* From kdegraphics:
*
* - kruler, a screen ruler
* - ksnapshot, a screen capture program
* - kview, an image viewer; <b>kimageviewer</b> (kview/kimageviewer):
*   KImageViewer::Viewer and KImageViewer::Canvas, the interfaces of
*   the KView parts.
*
*/
